s:\"Tavistock Pl, London WC1H 9SN, UK\",venueName:\"Mary Ward House Conference Centre\",type:\"address\",onlineInstructions:\"This event is online. The host will update the event with a meeting link, as well as instructions to attend the event.\",onlineUrl:void 0,country:\"united kingdom\",locality:\"greater london\",locale:\"tavistock pl, london wc1h 9sn, uk\",latLng:\"51.52513709999999, -0.1272743\",displayLocationPrimary:\"Mary Ward House Conference Centre\",displayLocationSecondary:\"London, United Kingdom\",displayLocationLongForm:\"Tavistock Pl, London WC1H 9SN, UK\",breadcrumbs:[{label:\"United Kingdom\",link:\"united-kingdom\"},{label:\"England\",link:\"gb--england\"},{label:\"London\",link:\"gb--england--london\"}]},locationCode:\"GB\",currency:\"GBP\",settings:{ticketPriceRangeDisplay:true}}],allEventsLoaded:true},host:{name:\"Black History Walks\",id:\"6935a995b23621dfb43310a1\",userId:\"ddMNpD67jeREDsLwpplzmOqZwei2\",slug:\"black-history-walks\",urls:{url:\"https://events.humanitix.com/host/black-history-walks\",shareUrl:\"https://events.humanitix.com/host/black-history-walks\"},logo:{imageId:\"RFygPAxQnuab1XFO8vgs\",src:\"https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/RFygPAxQnuab1XFO8vgs\",alt:\"Black History Walks's logo\",width:250,height:250},website:\"https://www.blackhistorywalks.co.uk\",socials:[{href:\"https://www.blackhistorywalks.co.uk\",network:\"Website\",name:void 0},{href:\"https://facebook.com/blackhistorywalks\",network:\"Facebook\",name:void 0},{href:\"https://instagram.com/blackhistorywalks\",network:\"Instagram\",name:void 0},{href:\"https://twitter.com/blackhistwalker\",network:\"Twitter\",name:void 0},{href:\"https://tiktok.com/@black.history.wal\",network:\"TikTok\",name:void 0}],followers:5750,banner:{imageId:\"JRp1WZYLQieVprOCJ2Ym\",src:\"https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/JRp1WZYLQieVprOCJ2Ym\",alt:\"Black History Walks's banner\",width:1600,height:800},description:\"\\u003Cp>Black History Walks offer \\u003Ca rel=\\\"nofollow\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" href=\\\"https://blackhistorywalks.co.uk/walks-tours/\\\">walking tours\\u003C/a>, \\u003Ca rel=\\\"nofollow\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" href=\\\"https://blackhistorywalks.co.uk/talks/\\\">educational talks\\u003C/a> and \\u003Ca rel=\\\"nofollow\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" href=\\\"https://blackhistorywalks.co.uk/films/\\\">films\\u003C/a> in London. We work with museums, schools, communities and universities to deliver a diverse and engaging programme of educational experiences for students, sightseers, businesses, film fans and anyone with an interest in history and learning.\\u003Cstrong> Read our revolutionary book ‘Black History Walks in London Volume\\u003C/strong> \\u003Cstrong>1\\u003C/strong>‘ \\u003Ca rel=\\\"nofollow\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" href=\\\"https://jacarandabooks.co.uk/products/black-history-walks-1?_pos=1&amp;_sid=7fc1a9b93&amp;_ss=r\\\">HERE\\u003C/a>   See our new \\u003Cstrong>James Baldwin\\u003C/strong> plaque \\u003Ca rel=\\\"nofollow\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" href=\\\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GQuGyD-SpLw&amp;t=15s\\\">HERE\\u003C/a>\\u003C/p>\\u003Cp>The dedicated Black History Walks team has been delivering some of the best walking tours in London for 20 years and has 25 years’ experience delivering film screenings and talks. In 2024 in association with New Balance, we curated the first ever Black History \\u003Cem>Run\\u003C/em>, see video \\u003Ca rel=\\\"nofollow\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" href=\\\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FHbtcqbkFfw&amp;t=45s\\\">HERE.\\u003C/a> \\u003Cstrong>Our helicopter tour of London can be seen\\u003C/strong> \\u003Ca rel=\\\"nofollow\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" href=\\\"https://blackhistorywalks.co.uk/walks/black-history-helicopter-tour-of-london/\\\">HERE\\u003C/a> \\u003Cstrong>Steam train/rive\\u003C/strong>r \\u003Cstrong>cruise and bus tour\\u003C/strong>s \\u003Ca rel=\\\"nofollow\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" href=\\\"https://www.eventbrite.co.uk/o/black-history-walks-2849465606\\\">HERE\\u003C/a> \\u003C/p>\\u003Cp>\\u003Cstrong>For our unique and pioneering GCSE History exam text book for schools produced in collaboration with Pearson Edexcel and used by 15,000 pupils in 140 schools\\u003C/strong>, click \\u003Ca rel=\\\"nofollow\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" href=\\\"https://www.pearsonschoolsandfecolleges.co.uk/secondary/subjects/history-secondary/pearson-edexcel-gcse-history-91/pearson-revise-pearson-edexcel-gcse-9-1-history/gcse-9-1-edexcel-history-migrants-in-britain-c-800-present-student-book-1\\\">HERE\\u003C/a>. The book features Black British Civil Rights activism in Notting Hill and is based on our walk in that area. BHW was Activist in Residence at UCL Sarah Parker Remond Centre (2021) \\u003Cstrong>\\u003Cem>Sign our petition to save 17 years of Black film history\\u003C/em>\\u003C/strong> \\u003Ca rel=\\\"nofollow\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" href=\\\"https://www.change.org/p/save-17-years-of-black-film-history-at-british-film-institute\\\">HERE\\u003C/a>\\u003C/p>\\u003Cp>\\u003Cstrong> See below for our NEXT walk, talk, film or river/canal tour\\u003C/strong>\\u003C/p>\",theme:{primaryColor:\"#ffb18f\",baseColor:\"#353337\",colorScheme:\"auto\",v3ColorsCssVariables:\"\\n        @layer colours{\\n            \\n:root{\\n\\t--colorv3-LIGHT-background-base: #ffffff;--colorv3-LIGHT-background-hover: #f2f2f2;--colorv3-LIGHT-background-active: #ebebeb;--colorv3-LIGHT-background-border: #e5e5e5;--colorv3-LIGHT-background-text-high: #0d0d0d;--colorv3-LIGHT-background-text-medium: #4c4c4c;--colorv3-LIGHT-background-text-low: #707070;--colorv3-LIGHT-background-text-disabled: #999999;--colorv3-LIGHT-background-text-primary: #a55735;--colorv3-LIGHT-background-text-success: #005B35;--colorv3-LIGHT-background-text-error: #8D0013;--colorv3-LIGHT-b