vg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 15 15\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" class=\"CrossIcon\" aria-label=\"Cross icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><title>Close icon</title><path d=\"M11.782 4.032a.575.575 0 1 0-.813-.814L7.5 6.687 4.032 3.218a.575.575 0 0 0-.814.814L6.687 7.5l-3.469 3.468a.575.575 0 0 0 .814.814L7.5 8.313l3.469 3.469a.575.575 0 0 0 .813-.814L8.313 7.5l3.469-3.468Z\" fill=\"currentColor\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><!----><span class=\"u-visually-hidden\">Close</span></button><!----><!----></dialog><!----></div><!----> <!--[-1--><!--]--> <!--[0--><div class=\"EventModules svelte-r64kdn\"><!--[--><!--[0--><!--[9--><div class=\"EventModuleRichText svelte-6ayzyh\"><!--[0--><h2 class=\"title f-heading-4 svelte-6ayzyh\">Description</h2><!--]--> <!--[-1--><!--]--> <div class=\"RichContent f-body-3 svelte-jgfn07\"><!--[0--><!----><h4>🌟 The National Social Media Awards (NSMA 2026)</h4><p>The <a rel=\"nofollow\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://nationalsocialmediaawards.co.uk/\"><strong>National Social Media Awards</strong></a> is the UK’s 1st and most premier celebration of <strong>influencer excellence, online creativity, and digital culture</strong>. From viral trailblazers to brand-building legends, the National Social Media Awards honour the influencers and brands shaping the future of online media.</p><p>This isn’t just an awards night — it’s a full-scale <strong>red carpet experience</strong>, bringing together influencers, celebrities, content creators, brands, and fans for an unforgettable evening of recognition, entertainment, and connection.</p><p>🎤 <strong>Live performances.</strong><br /><strong>🏆 Unmissable moments.</strong><br /><strong>💫 Real-time networking with digital icons.</strong></p><p>Whether you're a rising creator, a devoted fan, a brand wanting to stay plugged into culture, or someone who just loves the power of digital media — <strong>this is the event to be seen at</strong>.</p><p>🎟️ <strong>Buy your ticket now and be part of the UK’s most influential night in social media.</strong><br />Because if you’re part of the culture — you should be part of the celebration.</p><!----><!--]--></div><!----></div><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></div><!--]--> <div class=\"HumanitixBannerLarge svelte-17kav4o\"><div class=\"logos svelte-17kav4o\"><span class=\"powered-by f-label-1 svelte-17kav4o\">Powered by</span> <svg class=\"HumanitixLogoSvg svelte-pxa59x\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 139 34\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><title>Humanitix logo</title><g><!--[-1--><!--]--><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M12.37 23.84c-1.06 0-1.62-.57-1.62-1.63v-2.73a.66.66 0 0 0-.72-.72H6.35a.66.66 0 0 0-.72.72v2.73c0 1.06-.56 1.63-1.62 1.63H1.62C.56 23.84 0 23.27 0 22.2v-10.2c0-1.06.56-1.62 1.62-1.62h2.4c1.05 0 1.61.56 1.61 1.62v1.84a.66.66 0 0 0 .72.72h3.68a.66.66 0 0 0 .72-.72v-1.84c0-1.06.56-1.62 1.62-1.62h2.4c1.05 0 1.61.56 1.61 1.62v10.2c0 1.06-.56 1.63-1.62 1.63h-2.4ZM19.05 20.53v-8.52c0-1.06.56-1.62 1.62-1.62h2.2c1.06 0 1.62.56 1.62 1.62v6.67c0 .92.67 1.02 1.18 1.02.52 0 1.03-.03 1.54-.1a.68.68 0 0 0 .66-.75V12c0-1.06.56-1.62 1.62-1.62h2.23c1.06 0 1.62.56 1.62 1.62v10.2c0 1.06-.56 1.63-1.62 1.63H30.5c-.78 0-1.28-.2-1.57-.64l-.06-.09a.64.64 0 0 0-.5-.3.68.68 0 0 0-.35.11 12.3 12.3 0 0 1-5.08 1.14c-2.59 0-3.9-1.19-3.9-3.53ZM53.74 23.84c-1.06 0-1.62-.57-1.62-1.63v-6.67c0-.7-.31-1-1.07-1h-.4c-.26 0-.5.03-.76.07a.74.74 0 0 0-.6.8v6.8c0 1.06-.56 1.63-1.63 1.63h-1.98c-1.06 0-1.62-.57-1.62-1.63v-6.67c0-.69-.34-1-1.1-1-.35 0-.71.02-1.06.06-.4.04-.7.4-.66.8v6.81c0 1.06-.56 1.63-1.62 1.63h-2.18c-1.06 0-1.62-.57-1.62-1.63v-10.2c0-1.06.56-1.62 1.62-1.62h1.13c.68 0 1.15.16 1.46.51l.1.16c.12.18.28.38.53.38.12-.01.24-.05.35-.1A8.92 8.92 0 0 1 45.58 10c1.32 0 2.29.36 2.9 1.07.12.17.32.28.54.29.16-.01.3-.06.44-.16A7.4 7.4 0 0 1 53.74 10c2.52 0 3.8 1.24 3.8 3.7v8.51c0 1.06-.57 1.63-1.63 1.63h-2.17ZM63.88 24.22a5.3 5.3 0 0