scripts\\u003C/p>\\u003C/li>\\u003Cli>\\u003Cp>🎬 \\u003Cstrong>Rough cuts:\\u003C/strong>\\u003Cspan style=\\\"--custom-color-light:#FACADE;--custom-color-dark:#FACADE\\\">\\u003Cstrong> \\u003C/strong>\\u003C/span>screenings of rough cuts fresh from the edit\\u003C/p>\\u003C/li>\\u003Cli>\\u003Cp>🍿 \\u003Cstrong>Showcase:\\u003C/strong> screenings of finished sketches, ready to go!\\u003C/p>\\u003C/li>\\u003C/ul>\\u003Cp>\\u003Cspan style=\\\"--custom-color-light:#000000;--custom-color-dark:#cdcdcd\\\">As well as listening out for what makes you laugh, there’ll be space for more direct feedback too – so you can help us decide which bits to keep and which bits to burn forever 🔥\\u003C/span>\\u003C/p>\"}}],artists:[],seo:{jsonSchema:{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",name:\"Sketchburn 7: a scratch night for sketch comedy films\",url:\"https://events.humanitix.com/sketchburn-7-a-scratch-night-for-sketch-comedy-films\",startDate:\"2026-10-28T19:00:00+0000\",endDate:\"2026-10-28T20:00:00+0000\",location:{\"@type\":\"Place\",name:\"Etcetera Theatre\",address:{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",streetAddress:\"265 Camden High St, London NW1 8QR, UK\",postalCode:\"NW1 8QR\",addressRegion:\"England\",addressCountry:\"GB\"}},eventStatus:\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",eventAttendanceMode:\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",description:\"Once upon a time there was a prince who grew up in a castle with a king who only had sense receptors for his own fear…\",image:\"https://images.humanitix.com/i/3e19d5c6-eee0-40b7-9e0c-082246936ef5.jpg@seo-500.jpg\",offers:[{\"@type\":\"AggregateOffer\",offerCount:3,priceCurrency:\"GBP\",availabilityStarts:c,availability:\"InStock\",availabilityEnds:b},{\"@type\":\"Offer\",url:\"https://events.humanitix.com/sketchburn-7-a-scratch-night-for-sketch-comedy-films/tickets\",name:\"General Admission\",price:10,availability:\"InStock\",availabilityStarts:void 0,availabilityEnds:void 0,priceCurrency:\"GBP\",validFrom