 performance.</p><p>We programme year-round, including Camden Fringe, VOILÀ! Theatre Festival, Women Writers Festival, Camden Horror Fest, Edinburgh Fringe previews, artist development slots and independent productions.</p><p>Our venue offers:</p><ul><li><p>42-seat intimate theatre space</p></li><li><p>central Camden location</p></li><li><p>box office operation</p></li><li><p>front-of-house support</p></li><li><p>marketing support</p></li><li><p>livestreaming and hybrid event capability</p></li><li><p>rehearsal, workshop and performance hire</p></li></ul><p>We are committed to supporting bold, independent performance and helping artists reach audiences both in the room and beyond it.</p><p><strong>42 seats. Unlimited reach.</strong></p><!----><!--]--></div><!----></div><!----></div></div> <!--[-1--><!--]--><!----></div><!--]--></div><!--]--></aside><!----> <!--[0--><aside class=\"EventKeywords svelte-12d6v78\" aria-labelledby=\"EventKeywords-title\"><h2 class=\"f-heading-3 svelte-12d6v78\" id=\"EventKeywords-title\">Keywords</h2> <ul class=\"keywords svelte-12d6v78\"><!--[--><!--[0--><!----><li class=\"Badge f-label-2 svelte-3om6mv\" data-surface=\"sunken\" data-text=\"medium\">theatre <!----><!----></li><!----><!--]--><!--[0--><!----><li class=\"Badge f-label-2 svelte-3om6mv\" data-surface=\"sunken\" data-text=\"medium\">camden <!----><!----></li><!----><!--]--><!--[0--><!----><li class=\"Badge f-label-2 svelte-3om6mv\" data-surface=\"sunken\" data-text=\"medium\">london <!----><!----></li><!----><!--]--><!--[0--><!----><li class=\"Badge f-label-2 svelte-3om6mv\" data-surface=\"sunken\" data-text=\"medium\">show <!----><!----></li><!----><!--]--><!--[0--><!----><li class=\"Badge f-label-2 svelte-3om6mv\" data-surface=\"sunken\" data-text=\"medium\">drama <!----><!----></li><!----><!--]--><!--[0--><!----><li class=\"Badge f-label-2 svelte-3om6mv\" data-surface=\"sunken\" data-text=\"medium\">fringe <!----><!----></li><!----><!--]--><!--]--></ul></aside><!--]--></div