put.Text.s3-error\"><!--[-1--><!---->&nbsp;<!----><!--]--></div><!----></div><!----></div> <div class=\"email svelte-10psjnb\"><!--$s4--><div class=\"InputText  svelte-edfnjv\" data-testid=\"Email\"><!----><label class=\"InputLabel f-label-2 svelte-1rtr0xs\" for=\"Input.Text.s4\"><!--[-1--><span>Email</span><!--]--> <!--[0--><!--[0--><span aria-hidden=\"true\" data-text=\"low\">(required)</span><!--]--><!--]--> <!--[-1--><!--]--><!----></label><!----><!----> <!--[-1--><!--]--> <div class=\"field svelte-edfnjv\"><div class=\"border-container svelte-edfnjv\" data-surface=\"background\"><!--[-1--><!--]--> <!--[-1--><input class=\"f-body-3 svelte-edfnjv\" data-testid=\"Email-input\" id=\"Input.Text.s4\" name=\"email\" placeholder=\"\" aria-required=\"true\"/><!--]--> <!--[-1--><!--]--></div> <!----></div> <!--[-1--><!--]--> <div class=\"InputError f-label-2-thin svelte-1kqu8lk\" data-text=\"error\" id=\"Input.Text.s4-error\"><!--[-1--><!---->&nbsp;<!----><!--]--></div><!----></div><!----></div></div><!--]--><!----></div> <!--[0--><footer class=\"svelte-1vsf566\"><!--[-1--><!--]--> <!--[0--><!----><button data-variant=\"primary\" data-size=\"m\" class=\"Btn  svelte-17nnmqu f-label-3\" type=\"submit\" aria-disabled=\"false\" data-loading=\"false\"><!--[-1--><!--]--> <div class=\"content-container svelte-17nnmqu\"><!--[-1--><!--[-1-->Confirm<!--]--><!----><!--]--></div> <!--[-1--><!--]--><!----></button><!----><!--]--> <!--[-1--><!--]--></footer><!--]--></form></dialog><!----> <div class=\"ButtonGroup svelte-nd5zk7\"><!--[0--><!----><a data-variant=\"secondary\" data-size=\"m\" class=\"Btn  svelte-17nnmqu f-label-3\" href=\"the-roger-ely-experience/contact\" aria-disabled=\"false\" data-loading=\"false\" data-sveltekit-reload=\"true\"><!--[-1--><!--]--> <div class=\"content-container svelte-17nnmqu\"><!--[-1--><!---->Contact host<!----><!--]--></div> <!--[-1--><!--]--><!----></a><!----><!--]--> <!----><button data-variant=\"tertiary\" data-size=\"m\" class=\"Btn  svelte-17nnmqu f-label-3\" type=\"button\" aria-disabled=\"false\" data-loading=\"false\"><!--[-1--><!--]--> <div class=\"content-container svelte-17nnmqu\"><!--[-1--><!---->Follow<!----><!--]--></div> <!--[-1--><!--]--><!----></button><!----><!----> <!--[0--><!----><a data-variant=\"tertiary\" data-size=\"m\" class=\"Btn  svelte-17nnmqu f-label-3\" href=\"/host/the-experienced\" aria-disabled=\"false\" data-loading=\"false\" data-sveltekit-reload=\"true\"><!--[-1--><!--]--> <div class=\"content-container svelte-17nnmqu\"><!--[-1--><!---->View profile<!----><!--]--></div> <!--[-1--><!--]--><!----></a><!----><!--]--><!----></div><!----></div></div></header> <!--[0--><div class=\"socials svelte-1lc91aa\"><!--[0--><div class=\"SocialLinks svelte-1s84wya\"><ul class=\"svelte-1s84wya\"><!--[--><!--]--></ul></div><!--]--><!----></div><!--]--> <!--[0--><div class=\"desc svelte-1lc91aa\"><div class=\"HorizontalSplit\"><hr class=\"svelte-1tvqa1i\"/></div><!----> <div class=\"Collapsible svelte-ytl67q\" data-expanded=\"false\" style=\"--collapsed-height: 240px\" data-collapse-necessary=\"false\"><div class=\"inner\"><div class=\"text f-label-3\"><div class=\"RichContent f-body-3 svelte-jgfn07\"><!--[0--><!----><p><span style=\"--custom-color-light:#000000;--custom-color-dark:#cdcdcd\"><strong>The Roger Ely Experience - A Cabaret</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"--custom-color-light:#000000;--custom-color-dark:#cdcdcd\"><strong>Thursday 12 November 2026</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"--custom-color-light:#000000;--custom-color-dark:#cdcdcd\"><strong>20.00 </strong></span></p><p><span style=\"--custom-color-light:#000000;--custom-color-dark:#cdcdcd\"><strong>Tickets £12.50/£10 concessions</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"--custom-color-light:#000000;--custom-color-dark:#cdcdcd\"><strong>Bookings xxxxx</strong></span><strong><br /></strong></p><p><span style=\"--custom-color-light:#000000;--custom-color-dark:#cdcdcd\">An evening celebrating the life and legacy of Roger Ely. </span></p><p><span style=\"--custom-color-light:#000000;--custom-color-dark:#cdcdcd\">The Water Rats cabaret will showcase short turns and films by a wide range of artists, musicians and film makers connected to Roger including xxxxxx.  Full details to follow.</span><br /></p><p><span style=\"--custom-color-light:#000000;--custom-color-dark:#cdcdcd\">Roger Ely (1952 – 2015) was an extraordinary and influential artist, publisher, archivist, curator, and collector. This event marks the British Library’s acquisition of Roger’s extensive and unique archive, enabling generations to come to discover a significant, rare and unrivalled history of the alternative and counterculture of the late twentieth century.  </span><br /></p><p><span style=\"--custom-color-light:#000000;--custom-color-dark:#cdcdcd\">From Leeds Arts School in the 1960s, to the Brighton Contemporary Festival of Arts in the 1970s, to the Final Academy in the 1980s, to the Zap Club in the 1990s, Roger Ely was at the centre of the underground scene that influenced the art, music, film, literature, cabaret and performance that went on to change the world.  </span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"--custom-color-light:#000000;--custom-color-dark:#cdcdcd\">His collaborators, connections and collections are breathtaking - William Burroughs, Brion Gysin, Ian Hinchliffe, Genesis P-Orridge, John Giorno, Kathy Acker, John Maybury, Cosey Fanni Tutti, Lydia Lunch, Marc Almond, Kenneth Williams, Anne Bean. Paul Burwell, Derek Jarman and countless other luminaries and characters all feature in some way in his life and in his archive.</span><br /></p><p><span style=\"--custom-color-light:#000000;--custom-color-dark:#cdcdcd\">The Water Rats cabaret follows a discussion at the nearby British Library from 6.15 to 7.30 looking at Roger’s archive and the cultural landscapes it shines a light on with Steve Cleary, Dave Stephens, Neil Butler, Lois Keidan, Anne Bean, Barry Miles and Rob La Frenais.  Details here (add BL link)  </span></p><!----><!--]--></div><!----></div><!----></div></div> <!--[-1--><!--]--><!----></div><!--]--></div><!--]--></aside><!----> <!--[-1--><!--]--></div> <div class=\"fixedwrapper svelte-9qsyhv\" data-sticky-bottom-in-iframe=\"\"><div data-sticky-bottom-in-iframe-target=\"\"><section class=\"EventGetTickets svelte-1kcegs9\" data-surface=\"background\" data-skip-target=\"tickets\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-labelledby=\"get-tickets-label\"><h2 id=\"get-tickets-label\" class=\"u-visually-hidden\">Get tickets</h2> <!--[-1--><!--]--> <!----><a data-variant=\"primary\" data-size=\"l\" class=\"Btn  svelte-17nnmqu f-label-3\" href=\"https://events.humanitix.com/the-roger-ely-experience/tickets\" aria-disabled=\"false\" data-testid=\"get-tickets-btn\" data-loading=\"false\" data-sveltekit-reload=\"true\"><!--[-1--><!--]--> <div class=\"content-container svelte-17nnmqu\"><!--[-1--><!---->Get tickets<!----><!--]--></div> <!--[-1--><!--]--><!----></a><!----><!----></section><!----></div></div> <div class=\"stickytrack svelte-9qsyhv\" data-sticky-top-in-iframe-track=\"\"><div class=\"stickywrapper svelte-9qsyhv\" data-sticky-top-in-iframe=\"\"><section class=\"EventGetTickets svelte-1kcegs9\" data-surface=\"background\" data-skip-target=\"tickets\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-labelledby=\"get-tickets-label\"><h2 id=\"get-tickets-label\" class=\"u-visually-hidden\">Get tickets</h2> <!--[-1--><!--]--> <!----><a data-variant=\"primary\" data-size=\"l\" class=\"Btn  svelte-17nnmqu f-label-3\" href=\"https://events.humanitix.com/the-roger-ely-experience/tickets\" aria-disabled=\"false\" data-testid=\"get-tickets-btn\" data-loading=\"false\" data-sveltekit-reload=\"true\"><!--[-1--><!--]--> <div class=\"content-container svelte-17nnmqu\"><!--[-1--><!---->Get tickets<!----><!--]--></div> <!--[-1--><!--]--><!----></a><!----><!----></section><!----> <!--[-1--><!--]--> <!--[-1--><!--]--> <div class=\"detailssummarywrapper svelte-9qsyhv\" data-status=\"fadeout\" inert=\"\"><div class=\"detail datetime sv