" data-button-style=\"flat\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 15 15\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" class=\"CrossIcon\" aria-label=\"Cross icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><title>Close icon</title><path d=\"M11.782 4.032a.575.575 0 1 0-.813-.814L7.5 6.687 4.032 3.218a.575.575 0 0 0-.814.814L6.687 7.5l-3.469 3.468a.575.575 0 0 0 .814.814L7.5 8.313l3.469 3.469a.575.575 0 0 0 .813-.814L8.313 7.5l3.469-3.468Z\" fill=\"currentColor\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><!----><span class=\"u-visually-hidden\">Close</span></button><!----><!----></dialog><!----></div><!----> <!--[-1--><!--]--> <!--[0--><div class=\"EventModules svelte-r64kdn\"><!--[--><!--[0--><!--[9--><div class=\"EventModuleRichText svelte-6ayzyh\"><!--[0--><h2 class=\"title f-heading-4 svelte-6ayzyh\">Description</h2><!--]--> <!--[-1--><!--]--> <div class=\"RichContent f-body-3 svelte-jgfn07\"><!--[0--><!----><p><span style=\"--custom-color-light:#000000;--custom-color-dark:#cdcdcd\">Celebrating its 10th year Sweeties is back at the Etcetera Theatre with their bite sized pieces of drama brought to you by a group of talented emerging professional actors creating and sharing fantastic stories for an appreciative audience and specially invited film, television and theatre industry guests.   All profits from the show go to The Neurosciences Research Foundation based at St George's Hospital NHS Foundation Trust and St George’s University of London.</span></p><!----><!--]--></div><!----></div><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></div><!--]--> <div class=\"HumanitixBannerLarge svelte-17kav4o\"><div class=\"logos svelte-17kav4o\"><span class=\"powered-by f-label-1 svelte-17kav4o\">Powered by</span> <svg class=\"HumanitixLogoSvg svelte-pxa59x\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 139 34\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><title>Humanitix logo</title><g><!--[-1--><!--]--><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M12.37 23.84c-1.06 0-1.62-.57-1.62-1