34-.76.77-.76a.77.77 0 1 1-.77.76M8.7 12a3.29 3.29 0 1 1 6.58 0 3.29 3.29 0 0 1-6.58 0m5.42 0a2.13 2.13 0 1 0-4.26 0 2.13 2.13 0 0 0 4.26 0\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"/><!----></svg><!--]--> <span class=\"label f-label-2\" data-text=\"medium\">Instagram</span></a></li><!--]--></ul></div><!--]--><!----></div><!--]--> <!--[0--><div class=\"desc svelte-1lc91aa\"><div class=\"HorizontalSplit\"><hr class=\"svelte-1tvqa1i\"/></div><!----> <div class=\"Collapsible svelte-ytl67q\" data-expanded=\"false\" style=\"--collapsed-height: 240px\" data-collapse-necessary=\"false\"><div class=\"inner\"><div class=\"text f-label-3\"><div class=\"RichContent f-body-3 svelte-jgfn07\"><!--[0--><!----><p><strong>Etcetera Theatre</strong> is an award-winning 42-seat black box theatre in the heart of Camden Town, London.</p><p>Since 1986, we have supported emerging and established artists across theatre, comedy, new writing, festivals, workshops and experimental performance.</p><p>We programme year-round, including Camden Fringe, VOILÀ! Theatre Festival, Women Writers Festival, Camden Horror Fest, Edinburgh Fringe previews, artist development slots and independent productions.</p><p>Our venue offers:</p><ul><li><p>42-seat intimate theatre space</p></li><li><p>central Camden location</p></li><li><p>box office operation</p></li><li><p>front-of-house support</p></li><li><p>marketing support</p></li><li><p>livestreaming and hybrid event capability</p></li><li><p>rehearsal, workshop and performance hire</p></li></ul><p>We are committed to supporting bold, independent performance and helping artists reach audiences both in the room and beyond it.</p><p><strong>42 seats. Unlimited reach.</strong></p><!----><!--]--></div><!----></div><!----></div></div> <!--[-1--><!--]--><!----></div><!--]--></div><!--]--></aside><!----> <!--[0--><aside class=\"EventKeywords svelte-12d6v78\" aria-labelledby=\"EventKeywords-title\"><h2 class=\"f-heading-3 svelte-12d6v78\" id=\"EventKeywords-title\">Keywords</h2> <ul cl