ols the show while contestants compete for audience love. Because of budget cuts, \\\"celebrities\\\" are recreated using our own questionable artificial reality methods (deep fakes, video generation and AR glasses to send lines from a chatbot to control the \\\"celebrity\\\"). As contestants get replaced by AI, the show becomes a fast-paced high-tech satire of AI slop and voyeurism, by the award-winning pioneers of robot theatre.\\u003C/strong>\\u003C/span>\\u003C/p>\\u003Cp>\\u003Cspan style=\\\"--custom-color-light:#000000;--custom-color-dark:#cdcdcd\\\">\\u003Cbr />\\u003C/span>\\u003Ca rel=\\\"nofollow\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" href=\\\"https://instagram.com/improbotics\\\">\\u003Cspan style=\\\"--custom-color-light:#000000;--custom-color-dark:#cdcdcd\\\">\\u003Cstrong>https://instagram.com/improbotics\\u003C/strong>\\u003C/span>\\u003C/a>\\u003Cspan style=\\\"--custom-color-light:#000000;--custom-color-dark:#cdcdcd\\\">\\u003Cbr />\\u003Cbr />\\u003Cstrong>14+\\u003C/strong>\\u003C/span>\\u003C/p>\"}}],artists:[],seo:{jsonSchema:{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",name:\"Improbotics Presents: Artificial Reality\",url:\"https://events.humanitix.com/improbotics-presents-artificial-reality\",startDate:\"2026-10-28T21:00:00+0000\",endDate:\"2026-10-28T22:00:00+0000\",location:{\"@type\":\"Place\",name:\"Etcetera Theatre\",address:{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",streetAddress:\"265 Camden High St, London NW1 8QR, UK\",postalCode:\"NW1 8QR\",addressRegion:\"England\",addressCountry:\"GB\"}},eventStatus:\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",eventAttendanceMode:\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",description:\"Improvised show where audiences become producers of a reality show. \",image:\"https://images.humanitix.com/i/3c589580-da8a-482d-9beb-5b8df6d6c59b.png@seo-500.jpg\",offers:[{\"@type\":\"AggregateOffer\",offerCount:1,priceCurrency:\"GBP\",availabilityStarts:c,availability:\"InStock\",availabilityEnds:b},{\"@typ