:[{component:\"richtext\",props:{title:\"Description\",content:\"\\u003Cblockquote>\\u003Cp>\\u003Cspan style=\\\"--custom-color-light:#000000;--custom-color-dark:#d0d0d0\\\">The day is broke; be wary, look about. The odds are stacked against young Romeo and Juliet. Everyone makes mistakes, some are more fatal than others. Love can’t always save you, or her, or them, or anyone. But it matters. It matters worlds. It matters seas and stars and blood and breath. A pacy, pulsy thriller from 1597. \\u003Cbr />\\u003Cbr />From Achy Bits Productions (past reviews : ★★★★ The Derek Awards, ★★★★ Reviewsgate) \\u003C/span>\\u003C/p>\\u003Cp>\\u003C/p>\\u003Cp>\\u003Cspan style=\\\"--custom-color-light:#000000;--custom-color-dark:#d0d0d0\\\">Age rating: 12+, contains: death, violence, suicide, sexual themes\\u003Cbr />\\u003C/span>\\u003C/p>\\u003Cp>\\u003Cspan style=\\\"--custom-color-light:#000000;--custom-color-dark:#d0d0d0\\\">Instagram: @achybits_productions\\u003C/span>\\u003C/p>\\u003C/blockquote>\"}}],artists:[],seo:{jsonSchema:[{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",name:\"Romeo and Juliet\",url:\"https://events.humanitix.com/romeo-and-juliet-7yrer9s8\",startDate:\"2026-11-23T21:00:00+0000\",endDate:\"2026-11-23T22:00:00+0000\",location:a,eventStatus:\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",eventAttendanceMode:\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",description:\"The day is broke; be wary, look about. The odds are stacked against young Romeo and Juliet. Everyone makes mistakes, some are more fatal than others. \",image:\"https://images.humanitix.com/i/903fb073-ce85-4e9e-988b-fa8e642e8c29.png@seo-500.jpg\",offers:b},{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",name:\"Romeo and Juliet\",url:\"https://events.humanitix.com/romeo-and-juliet-7yrer9s8\",startDate:\"2026-11-24T21:00:00+0000\",endDate:\"2026-11-24T22:00:00+0000\",location:a,eventStatus:\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",eventAttendanceMode:\"https://schema.org/OfflineEven