ext=\\\"warning\\\"]{color:var(--colorv3-current-text-warning)}\\n\\t[data-text=\\\"info\\\"]{color:var(--colorv3-current-text-info)}\\n        }\\n    \",ticketButtonText:\"Get tickets\"},settings:{afterCheckoutRedirect:void 0,allowTicketAndMerchSwaps:false,allowUserEdit:true,codesViaLinkOnly:false,disableHumanitixGTM:false,hideAddToCalendar:false,hideArtistPreviews:false,removeImpactCommunication:false,requireEmailConfirmation:false,sendTickets:true,noTicketsMessagingOption:\"none\",showTicketsLeft:false,minimumTicketsPerOrder:void 0,maximumTicketsPerOrder:void 0,seatingMapEditable:false,enableV3SeatMaps:false,waitlistEnabled:false,salesStopped:false,hideConfetti:false,mobileRequired:true},eventModules:[{component:\"richtext\",props:{title:\"Description\",content:\"\\u003Cp>'Fresh off a sold-out show and being featured in 'Best of the Sketch' at the Toronto Sketch Festival, performing in the Montréal Sketch Festival and being a quarter-finalist in Sketch to the Death with her troupe 'TIK TOK BOOM' whilst in Canada, and having just finished her run as a cast member in London's longest-running sketch show NewsRevue, Siobhán Cran is happy to be back home and bring her first solo sketch show to London!\\u003Cspan style=\\\"--custom-color-light:#FACADE;--custom-color-dark:#FACADE\\\">\\u003Cbr />Minus AI is 100% human. From the ideas, to the writing, to the creating, to the performances. Hell, even the poster is handmade. It's a celebration of the joy that humans create and the silliness we often find ourselves in. And it's a sketch show, so with no scene being over 5 minutes, even fried attention spans will be able to have a great time.\\u003C/span>\\u003Cbr />\\u003Cbr />\\u003Cspan style=\\\"--custom-color-light:#FACADE;--custom-color-dark:#FACADE\\\">This show promises two things: lots of laughs and absolutely no Artificial Intelligence. Our intelligence is homemade.’\\u003C/span>\\u003C/p>\"}}],artists:[],seo:{jsonSchema:[{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",name:\"Minus AI: A 100% human sketch show\",url:\"https://events.humanitix.com/minus-ai-a-100-human-sketch-show\",startDate:\"2027-01-11T21:00:00+0000\",endDate:\"2027-01-11T22:00:00+0000\",location:a,eventStatus:\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",eventAttendanceMode:\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",description:\"'Fresh off a sold-out show and being featured in 'Best of the Sketch' at the Toronto Sketch Festival.\",image:\"https://images.humanitix.com/i/661b6a9f-1956-4b5f-a1a6-83e9e8437944.jpeg@seo-500.jpg\",offers:b},{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",name:\"Minus AI: A 100% human sketch show\",url:\"https://events.humanitix.com/minus-ai-a-100-human-sketch-show\",startDate:\"2027-01-12T21:00:00+0000\",endDate:\"2027-01-12T22:00:00+0000\",location:a,eventStatus:\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",eventAttendanceMode:\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",description:\"'Fresh off a sold-out show and being featured in 'Best of the Sketch' at the Toronto Sketch Festival.\",image:\"https://images.humanitix.com/i/661b6a9f-1956-4b5f-a1a6-83e9e8437944.jpeg@seo-500.jpg\",offers:b},{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",name:\"Minus AI: A 100% human sketch show\",url:\"https://events.humanitix.com/minus-ai-a-100-human-sketch-show\",startDate:\"2027-01-13T21:00:00+0000\",endDate:\"2027-01-13T22:00:00+0000\",location:a,eventStatus:\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",eventAttendanceMode:\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",description:\"'Fresh off a sold-out show and being featured in 'Best of the Sketch' at the Toronto Sketch Festival.\",image:\"https://images.humanitix.com/i/661b6a9f-1956-4b5f-a1a6-83e9e8437944.jpeg@seo-500.jpg\",offers:b}],title:\"Minus AI: A 100% human sketch show\",descriptions:{default:\"Get tickets on Humanitix - Minus AI: A 100% human sketch show hosted by Etcetera Theatre Camden. Etcetera Theatre, 265 Camden High St, London NW1 8QR, UK. Dates from Mon