[9--><div class=\"EventModuleRichText svelte-6ayzyh\"><!--[0--><h2 class=\"title f-heading-4 svelte-6ayzyh\">Description</h2><!--]--> <!--[-1--><!--]--> <div class=\"RichContent f-body-3 svelte-jgfn07\"><!--[0--><!----><p><strong>Welcome to the first live show of the Gavin’s Graveyard Gold podcast!</strong> <br /><br /><strong>Father and daughter, Gavin and El Tripplehorne, bring their lost media horror podcast to the stage. They’ll share tales of forgotten horror icons, Wyrd happenings and, for the first time in the UK, a live reading of a cursed radio play script.</strong> <br /><br /><strong>What could possibly go wrong?!</strong> </p><p><a rel=\"nofollow\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"http://www.wyrdworks.co.uk\"><span style=\"--custom-color-light:#FACADE;--custom-color-dark:#FACADE\"><strong>www.wyrdworks.co.uk</strong></span></a><span style=\"--custom-color-light:#FACADE;--custom-color-dark:#FACADE\"><strong> </strong> <br /><strong>Instagram &amp; TikTok: @wyrdworksltd</strong> </span>- </p><p><strong> </strong><a rel=\"nofollow\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://open.spotify.com/episode/6uJFIU5gTWKE0jWJ0X1Hsk?si=k5-fBWuvSliricy9X31hrw\"><strong>https://open.spotify.com/episode/6uJFIU5gTWKE0jWJ0X1Hsk?si=k5-fBWuvSliricy9X31hrw</strong></a>  </p><p></p><p><strong>Age: 15+</strong> </p><!----><!--]--></div><!----></div><!--]--><!--]--><!--[0--><!--[11--><div class=\"EventModuleVideo\"><!--[0--><h2 class=\"title f-heading-4 svelte-5nrv99\">Video</h2><!--]--> <!--[1--><a class=\"fallback f-body-3 svelte-5nrv99\" href=\"https://open.spotify.com/episode/6uJFIU5gTWKE0jWJ0X1Hsk?si=k5-fBWuvSliricy9X31hrw\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://open.spotify.com/episode/6uJFIU5gTWKE0jWJ0X1Hsk?si=k5-fBWuvSliricy9X31hrw</a><!--]--></div><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></div><!--]--> <div class=\"HumanitixBannerLarge svelte-17kav4o\"><div class=\"logos svelte-17kav4o\"><span class=\"powered-by f-label-1 svelte-17kav4o\">Powered by</span