 charity</span></p></div><!----> <aside class=\"EventLocation svelte-1qp4bh7\" aria-label=\"EventLocation-title\"><h2 class=\"f-heading-4 svelte-1qp4bh7\" id=\"EventLocation-title\">Location</h2> <div class=\"content svelte-1qp4bh7\"><!--[-1--><div class=\"address\"><div class=\"f-label-3\">Etcetera Theatre</div> <div><address class=\"f-body-3-thin svelte-1qp4bh7\">265 Camden High St, London NW1 8QR, UK</address> <!--[-1--><!--]--> <!--[-1--><!--]--></div></div> <!--[0--><!----><a data-variant=\"secondary\" data-size=\"m\" class=\"Btn  svelte-17nnmqu f-label-3\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=51.5406127,-0.1443946&amp;query_place_id=EiYyNjUgQ2FtZGVuIEhpZ2ggU3QsIExvbmRvbiBOVzEgOFFSLCBVSyIxEi8KFAoSCU8ZE53hGnZIEa4hb84xHXvJEIkCKhQKEglZ6JI24Bp2SBGRZZYs6GRimA\" aria-disabled=\"false\" data-loading=\"false\" data-sveltekit-reload=\"true\"><!--[-1--><!--]--> <div class=\"content-container svelte-17nnmqu\"><!--[-1--><!---->Get directions<!----><!--]--></div> <!--[-1--><!--]--><!----></a><!----><!--]--><!--]--> <!--[0--><!----><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=51.5406127,-0.1443946&amp;query_place_id=EiYyNjUgQ2FtZGVuIEhpZ2ggU3QsIExvbmRvbiBOVzEgOFFSLCBVSyIxEi8KFAoSCU8ZE53hGnZIEa4hb84xHXvJEIkCKhQKEglZ6JI24Bp2SBGRZZYs6GRimA\" class=\"mapwrapper svelte-1qp4bh7\"><div class=\"MapImage svelte-8kil5\" data-surface=\"background\"><!--[-1--><!--]--></div><!----></a><!----><!--]--></div></aside><!----> <!--[0--><!--$s2--><aside class=\"EventRefundPolicy\" aria-labelledby=\"s2\"><h2 class=\"f-heading-3 svelte-rew0v4\" data-text=\"high\" id=\"s2\">Refund policy</h2> <p class=\"f-body-2 svelte-rew0v4\">Refunds are available up to 1 day prior to the event</p></aside><!--]--> <aside class=\"EventHost\" data-no-host=\"false\" aria-labelledby=\"EventHost-title\"><h2 class=\"f-heading-4 svelte-1lc91aa\" id=\"EventHost-title\">Host<span class=\"u-visually-hidden\">information</span></h2> <!--[0--><div class=\"content\" data-box=\"8\"><head