ontent-container svelte-17nnmqu\"><!--[-1--><!---->Outlook desktop<!----><!--]--></div> <!--[-1--><!--]--><!----></button><!----><!----></li> <li class=\"svelte-5h8gi0\"><!----><button data-variant=\"secondary\" data-size=\"m\" class=\"Btn  svelte-17nnmqu f-label-3\" type=\"button\" aria-disabled=\"true\" data-loading=\"false\"><!--[0--><div class=\"right-container svelte-17nnmqu\"><!--[1--><!--[--><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"19\" height=\"17\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M.501 4.395h3.433l1.998 5.113 2.025-5.113H11.3L6.267 16.5H2.903l1.378-3.208L.5 4.395Zm14.69 4.086h-3.744L14.77.5h3.73L15.19 8.48Zm-2.763.764a2.08 2.08 0 1 1 0 4.158 2.08 2.08 0 0 1 0-4.158Z\" fill=\"#5F01D1\"></path></svg><!--]--><!--]--></div><!--]--> <div class=\"content-container svelte-17nnmqu\"><!--[-1--><!---->Yahoo<!----><!--]--></div> <!--[-1--><!--]--><!----></button><!----><!----></li></ul><!----></div><!----></div><!----><!----></div> <button class=\"ModalCloseButton svelte-t3wwh4\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Close dialog\" data-trap-boundary=\"last\" data-button-style=\"flat\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 15 15\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" class=\"CrossIcon\" aria-label=\"Cross icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><title>Close icon</title><path d=\"M11.782 4.032a.575.575 0 1 0-.813-.814L7.5 6.687 4.032 3.218a.575.575 0 0 0-.814.814L6.687 7.5l-3.469 3.468a.575.575 0 0 0 .814.814L7.5 8.313l3.469 3.469a.575.575 0 0 0 .813-.814L8.313 7.5l3.469-3.468Z\" fill=\"currentColor\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><!----><span class=\"u-visually-hidden\">Close</span></button><!----><!----></dialog><!----></div><!----> <!--[-1--><!--]--> <!--[0--><div class=\"EventModules svelte-r64kdn\"><!--[--><!--[0--><!--[9--><div class=\"EventModuleRichText svelte-6ayzyh\"><!--[0--><h2 class=\"title f-heading-4 svelte-6ayzyh\">Description</h2><!--]--> <!--[-1--><!--]--> <div class=\"RichContent f-body-3 svelte-jgfn07\"><!--[0--><!----><p><strong>FRUIT SALAD</strong></p><p><br />What happens when you try to measure a life that refuses to fit the numbers? </p><p></p><p><em>Fruit Salad</em> is a darkly comic psychological horror solo performance following a young woman whose childhood obsession with food, numbers and rules slowly becomes something far more sinister. </p><p></p><p>From fruit and calorie counts to beauty, punishment and the impossible mathematics of being “good enough”, she has learned that everything can be measured, and that every number has a consequence. </p><p></p><p>As childhood memories bleed into the present, her carefully constructed logic begins to unravel, revealing the disturbing cost of trying to calculate your own worth.</p><p></p><p><strong>A dark, intimate and unsettling exploration of food, femininity, control and the things we learn to believe about our bodies.</strong></p><!----><!--]--></div><!----></div><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></div><!--]--> <div class=\"HumanitixBannerLarge svelte-17kav4o\"><div class=\"logos svelte-17kav4o\"><span class=\"powered-by f-label-1 svelte-17kav4o\">Powered by</span> <svg class=\"HumanitixLogoSvg svelte-pxa59x\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 139 34\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><title>Humanitix logo</title><g><!--[-1--><!--]--><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M12.37 23.84c-1.06 0-1.62-.57-1.62-1.63v-2.73a.66.66 0 0 0-.72-.72H6.35a.66.66 0 0 0-.72.72v2.73c0 1.06-.56 1.63-1.62 1.63H1.62C.56 23.84 0 23.27 0 22.2v-10.2c0-1.06.56-1.62 1.62-1.62h2.4c1.05 0 1.61.56 1.61 1.62v1.84a.66.66 0 0 0 .72.72h3.68a.66.66 0 0 0 .72-.72v-1.84c0-1.06.56-1.62 1.62-1.62h2.4c1.05 0 1.61.56 1.61 1.62v10.2c0 1.06-.56 1.63-1.62 1.63h-2.4ZM19.05 20.53v-8.52c0-1.06.56-1.62 1.62-1.62h2.2c1.06 0 1.62.56 1.62 1.62v6.67c0 .92.67 1.02 1.18 1.02.52 0 1.03-.03 1.54-.1a.68.68 0 0 0 .66-.75V12c0-1.06.56-1.62 1.62-1.62h2.23c1.06 0 1.62.56 1.62 1.62v10.2c0 1.06-.56 1.63-1.62 1.63H30.5c-.78 0-1.28-.2-1.57-.6