ll=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M.501 4.395h3.433l1.998 5.113 2.025-5.113H11.3L6.267 16.5H2.903l1.378-3.208L.5 4.395Zm14.69 4.086h-3.744L14.77.5h3.73L15.19 8.48Zm-2.763.764a2.08 2.08 0 1 1 0 4.158 2.08 2.08 0 0 1 0-4.158Z\" fill=\"#5F01D1\"></path></svg><!--]--><!--]--></div><!--]--> <div class=\"content-container svelte-17nnmqu\"><!--[-1--><!---->Yahoo<!----><!--]--></div> <!--[-1--><!--]--><!----></button><!----><!----></li></ul><!----></div><!----></div><!----><!----></div> <button class=\"ModalCloseButton svelte-t3wwh4\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Close dialog\" data-trap-boundary=\"last\" data-button-style=\"flat\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 15 15\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" class=\"CrossIcon\" aria-label=\"Cross icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><title>Close icon</title><path d=\"M11.782 4.032a.575.575 0 1 0-.813-.814L7.5 6.687 4.032 3.218a.575.575 0 0 0-.814.814L6.687 7.5l-3.469 3.468a.575.575 0 0 0 .814.814L7.5 8.313l3.469 3.469a.575.575 0 0 0 .813-.814L8.313 7.5l3.469-3.468Z\" fill=\"currentColor\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><!----><span class=\"u-visually-hidden\">Close</span></button><!----><!----></dialog><!----></div><!----> <!--[-1--><!--]--> <!--[0--><div class=\"EventModules svelte-r64kdn\"><!--[--><!--[0--><!--[9--><div class=\"EventModuleRichText svelte-6ayzyh\"><!--[0--><h2 class=\"title f-heading-4 svelte-6ayzyh\">Description</h2><!--]--> <!--[-1--><!--]--> <div class=\"RichContent f-body-3 svelte-jgfn07\"><!--[0--><!----><p><span style=\"--custom-color-light:#000000;--custom-color-dark:#d0d0d0\"><strong>Off-Label: Coming Out, Getting Out: Not as prescribed</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"--custom-color-light:#000000;--custom-color-dark:#d0d0d0\">Ex-GP Rachel Hogg shares stories from her journey from doctor to patient, in this comedy show - fresh from the Edinburgh Fringe!</span></p><p><span style=\"--custom-color-light:#000000;--custom-color-dark:#d0d0d0\">Rachel explores the labels she’s collected along the way: gay, mid-life, ADHD; and shares the hilarious results of 'not living as prescribed.'</span></p><p><span style=\"--custom-color-light:#000000;--custom-color-dark:#d0d0d0\">Get ready to swallow a small dose of the hard stuff, and an overdose of silly fun, musical medical tongue twisters and groan-inducing puns.</span></p><p><span style=\"--custom-color-light:#000000;--custom-color-dark:#d0d0d0\">Why did she go wolf-tracking? What happened to that avocado?</span></p><p><span style=\"--custom-color-light:#000000;--custom-color-dark:#d0d0d0\">Oh yes, and the labels: are they helpful? Or are we better off without them?</span></p><p><span style=\"--custom-color-light:#000000;--custom-color-dark:#d0d0d0\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"--custom-color-light:#000000;--custom-color-dark:#d0d0d0\"><em>“Rachel weaves her story with humour and creativity.</em></span></p><p><span style=\"--custom-color-light:#000000;--custom-color-dark:#d0d0d0\"><em>Funny, innovative and good medicine. Go see it!!’ Ed Fringe</em></span></p><p><span style=\"--custom-color-light:#000000;--custom-color-dark:#d0d0d0\"><br /></span><a rel=\"nofollow\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/hoggdoesstandup?stkn=MTMxaXQzZnk4OHV3dQ==\"><span style=\"--custom-color-light:#000000;--custom-color-dark:#d0d0d0\">https://www.instagram.com/hoggdoesstandup?stkn=MTMxaXQzZnk4OHV3dQ==</span></a></p><!----><!--]--></div><!----></div><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></div><!--]--> <div class=\"HumanitixBannerLarge svelte-17kav4o\"><div class=\"logos svelte-17kav4o\"><span class=\"powered-by f-label-1 svelte-17kav4o\">Powered by</span> <svg class=\"HumanitixLogoSvg svelte-pxa59x\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 139 34\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><title>Humanitix logo</title><g><!--[-1--><!--]--><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M12.37 23.84c-1.06 0-1.62-.57-1.62-1.63v-2.73a.66.66 0