ary\\\"]{color:var(--colorv3-current-text-primary)}\\n\\t[data-text=\\\"success\\\"]{color:var(--colorv3-current-text-success)}\\n\\t[data-text=\\\"error\\\"]{color:var(--colorv3-current-text-error)}\\n\\t[data-text=\\\"warning\\\"]{color:var(--colorv3-current-text-warning)}\\n\\t[data-text=\\\"info\\\"]{color:var(--colorv3-current-text-info)}\\n        }\\n    \",ticketButtonText:\"Get tickets\"},settings:{afterCheckoutRedirect:void 0,allowTicketAndMerchSwaps:false,allowUserEdit:true,codesViaLinkOnly:false,disableHumanitixGTM:false,hideAddToCalendar:false,hideArtistPreviews:false,removeImpactCommunication:false,requireEmailConfirmation:false,sendTickets:true,noTicketsMessagingOption:\"none\",showTicketsLeft:false,minimumTicketsPerOrder:void 0,maximumTicketsPerOrder:void 0,seatingMapEditable:false,enableV3SeatMaps:false,waitlistEnabled:false,salesStopped:false,hideConfetti:false,mobileRequired:true},eventModules:[{component:\"richtext\",props:{title:\"Description\",content:\"\\u003Cp>\\u003Cspan style=\\\"--custom-color-light:#000000;--custom-color-dark:#d0d0d0\\\">\\u003Cstrong>Off-Label: Coming Out, Getting Out: Not as prescribed\\u003C/strong>\\u003C/span>\\u003C/p>\\u003Cp>\\u003Cspan style=\\\"--custom-color-light:#000000;--custom-color-dark:#d0d0d0\\\">Ex-GP Rachel Hogg shares stories from her journey from doctor to patient, in this comedy show - fresh from the Edinburgh Fringe!\\u003C/span>\\u003C/p>\\u003Cp>\\u003Cspan style=\\\"--custom-color-light:#000000;--custom-color-dark:#d0d0d0\\\">Rachel explores the labels she’s collected along the way: gay, mid-life, ADHD; and shares the hilarious results of 'not living as prescribed.'\\u003C/span>\\u003C/p>\\u003Cp>\\u003Cspan style=\\\"--custom-color-light:#000000;--custom-color-dark:#d0d0d0\\\">Get ready to swallow a small dose of the hard stuff, and an overdose of silly fun, musical medical tongue twisters and groan-inducing puns.\\u003C/span>\\u003C/p>\\u003Cp>\\u003Cspan style=\\\"--custom-color-light:#000000;--custom-color-dark:#d0d0d0\\\">Why did she go wolf-tracking? What happened to that avocado?\\u003C/span>\\u003C/p>\\u003Cp>\\u003Cspan style=\\\"--custom-color-light:#000000;--custom-color-dark:#d0d0d0\\\">Oh yes, and the labels: are they helpful? Or are we better off without them?\\u003C/span>\\u003C/p>\\u003Cp>\\u003Cspan style=\\\"--custom-color-light:#000000;--custom-color-dark:#d0d0d0\\\">\\u003Cbr />\\u003C/span>\\u003C/p>\\u003Cp>\\u003Cspan style=\\\"--custom-color-light:#000000;--custom-color-dark:#d0d0d0\\\">\\u003Cem>“Rachel weaves her story with humour and creativity.\\u003C/em>\\u003C/span>\\u003C/p>\\u003Cp>\\u003Cspan style=\\\"--custom-color-light:#000000;--custom-color-dark:#d0d0d0\\\">\\u003Cem>Funny, innovative and good medicine. Go see it!!’ Ed Fringe\\u003C/em>\\u003C/span>\\u003C/p>\\u003Cp>\\u003Cspan style=\\\"--custom-color-light:#000000;--custom-color-dark:#d0d0d0\\\">\\u003Cbr />\\u003C/span>\\u003Ca rel=\\\"nofollow\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" href=\\\"https://www.instagram.com/hoggdoesstandup?stkn=MTMxaXQzZnk4OHV3dQ==\\\">\\u003Cspan style=\\\"--custom-color-light:#000000;--custom-color-dark:#d0d0d0\\\">https://www.instagram.com/hoggdoesstandup?stkn=MTMxaXQzZnk4OHV3dQ==\\u003C/span>\\u003C/a>\\u003C/p>\"}}],artists:[],seo:{jsonSchema:{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",name:\"Off-Label: Coming Out, Getting Out: Not as prescribed\",url:\"https://events.humanitix.com/off-label-coming-out-getting-out-not-as-prescribed\",startDate:\"2026-10-10T17:00:00+0100\",endDate:\"2026-10-10T18:00:00+0100\",location:{\"@type\":\"Place\",name:\"Etcetera Theatre\",address:{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",streetAddress:\"265 Camden High St, London NW1 8QR, UK\",postalCode:\"NW1 8QR\",addressRegion:\"England\",addressCountry:\"GB\"}},eventStatus:\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",eventAttendanceMode:\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",description:\"Off-Label: Coming Out, Getting Out: Not as prescribed\\