ew’s entertaining lecture will also shine a flashlight on a suspect with family ties to a venerated unionist politician, as well as exploring Belfast’s links to a potential Royal ‘Ripper’.\\u003C/p>\"}}],artists:[],seo:{jsonSchema:[{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",name:\"Jack the Ripper: From Hell to Belfast\",url:\"https://events.humanitix.com/jack-the-ripper-from-hell-to-belfast\",startDate:\"2026-10-11T15:00:00+0100\",endDate:\"2026-10-11T16:00:00+0100\",location:a,eventStatus:\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",eventAttendanceMode:\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",description:\"Jack the Ripper: From Hell to Belfast\\n\",image:\"https://images.humanitix.com/i/95d6c928-046c-4061-b7e5-25d4a216cfe8.jpg@seo-500.jpg\",offers:b},{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",name:\"Jack the Ripper: From Hell to Belfast\",url:\"https://events.humanitix.com/jack-the-ripper-from-hell-to-belfast\",startDate:\"2026-10-12T15:00:00+0100\",endDate:\"2026-10-12T16:00:00+0100\",location:a,eventStatus:\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",eventAttendanceMode:\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",description:\"Jack the Ripper: From Hell to Belfast\\n\",image:\"https://images.humanitix.com/i/95d6c928-046c-4061-b7e5-25d4a216cfe8.jpg@seo-500.jpg\",offers:b},{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",name:\"Jack the Ripper: From Hell to Belfast\",url:\"https://events.humanitix.com/jack-the-ripper-from-hell-to-belfast\",startDate:\"2026-10-13T15:00:00+0100\",endDate:\"2026-10-13T16:00:00+0100\",location:a,eventStatus:\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",eventAttendanceMode:\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",description:\"Jack the Ripper: From Hell to Belfast\\n\",image:\"https://images.humanitix.com/i/95d6c928-046c-4061-b7e5-25d4a216cfe8.jpg@seo-500.jpg\",offers:b}],title:\"Jack the Ripper: From Hell to Belfast\",descriptions:{default:\"Get tickets on Humanitix - Jack the Ripper: From Hell to 