ntal performance.\\u003C/p>\\u003Cp>We programme year-round, including Camden Fringe, VOILÀ! Theatre Festival, Women Writers Festival, Camden Horror Fest, Edinburgh Fringe previews, artist development slots and independent productions.\\u003C/p>\\u003Cp>Our venue offers:\\u003C/p>\\u003Cul>\\u003Cli>\\u003Cp>42-seat intimate theatre space\\u003C/p>\\u003C/li>\\u003Cli>\\u003Cp>central Camden location\\u003C/p>\\u003C/li>\\u003Cli>\\u003Cp>box office operation\\u003C/p>\\u003C/li>\\u003Cli>\\u003Cp>front-of-house support\\u003C/p>\\u003C/li>\\u003Cli>\\u003Cp>marketing support\\u003C/p>\\u003C/li>\\u003Cli>\\u003Cp>livestreaming and hybrid event capability\\u003C/p>\\u003C/li>\\u003Cli>\\u003Cp>rehearsal, workshop and performance hire\\u003C/p>\\u003C/li>\\u003C/ul>\\u003Cp>We are committed to supporting bold, independent performance and helping artists reach audiences both in the room and beyond it.\\u003C/p>\\u003Cp>\\u003Cstrong>42 seats. Unlimited reach.\\u003C/strong>\\u003C/p>\",theme:{primaryColor:\"#ffb18f\",baseColor:\"#353337\",colorScheme:\"auto\",v3ColorsCssVariables:\"\\n        @layer colours{\\n            \\n:root{\\n\\t--colorv3-LIGHT-background-base: #ffffff;--colorv3-LIGHT-background-hover: #f2f2f2;--colorv3-LIGHT-background-active: #ebebeb;--colorv3-LIGHT-background-border: #e5e5e5;--colorv3-LIGHT-background-text-high: #0d0d0d;--colorv3-LIGHT-background-text-medium: #4c4c4c;--colorv3-LIGHT-background-text-low: #707070;--colorv3-LIGHT-background-text-disabled: #999999;--colorv3-LIGHT-background-text-primary: #a55735;--colorv3-LIGHT-background-text-success: #005B35;--colorv3-LIGHT-background-text-error: #8D0013;--colorv3-LIGHT-background-text-warning: #886800;--colorv3-LIGHT-background-text-info: #243F93;--colorv3-LIGHT-raised-base: #f9f9f9;--colorv3-LIGHT-raised-hover: #ececec;--colorv3-LIGHT-raised-active: #e5e5e5;--colorv3-LIGHT-raised-border: #d6d6d6;--colorv3-LIGHT-raised-text-high: #0d0d0d;--colorv3-LIGHT-raised-text-medium: #4a4a4a;--colorv3-