lity. Beginning as a morning-after comedy of errors, the fuse is lit for the play to slowly develop into the unravelling of sisterhood. Through clashing personalities and different life stages, distance creeps in. This funny and honest play begs the question: how well do we understand the people we love, and what happens when we don't?\\u003C/span>\\u003C/p>\\u003Cp>\\u003C/p>\\u003Cp>\\u003Cspan style=\\\"--custom-color-light:#000000;--custom-color-dark:#d0d0d0\\\">Socials: Instagram and Tiktok both @weweresisters\\u003C/span>\\u003C/p>\\u003Cp>\\u003Cspan style=\\\"--custom-color-light:#000000;--custom-color-dark:#d0d0d0\\\">Triggers and Age Rating: Emetophobia, family issues, 14+\\u003C/span>\\u003C/p>\\u003Cp>\\u003C/p>\"}}],artists:[],seo:{jsonSchema:[{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",name:\"We Were Sisters\",url:\"https://events.humanitix.com/we-were-sisters\",startDate:\"2026-12-01T19:00:00+0000\",endDate:\"2026-12-01T20:00:00+0000\",location:a,eventStatus:\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",eventAttendanceMode:\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",description:\"What happens when your supposed \\\"built-in best friend\\\" becomes someone you can't stand?\\n\",image:\"https://images.humanitix.com/i/1b20931b-d706-4c79-803f-44a310f4219c.png@seo-500.jpg\",offers:b},{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",name:\"We Were Sisters\",url:\"https://events.humanitix.com/we-were-sisters\",startDate:\"2026-12-02T14:00:00+0000\",endDate:\"2026-12-02T15:00:00+0000\",location:a,eventStatus:\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",eventAttendanceMode:\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",description:\"What happens when your supposed \\\"built-in best friend\\\" becomes someone you can't stand?\\n\",image:\"https://images.humanitix.com/i/1b20931b-d706-4c79-803f-44a310f4219c.png@seo-500.jpg\",offers:b},{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",name:\"We Were Sisters\",url:\"https://events.humanitix.co